flowchart TD
    Start([User opens /p/:projectId/docs]) --> FetchDocs[Load Document Explorer List]
    
    FetchDocs --> RenderDocs[Render Docs grouped by classification: Public | Internal | Restricted]
    NoteRestricted[Restricted docs without grant are completely omitted] -.-> RenderDocs
    
    RenderDocs --> UserChoice{User Action?}
    
    %% Flow 1: Create New Document
    UserChoice -- Click 'New Document' --> CheckCreateAuth{Role can create doc?}
    CheckCreateAuth -- No: VIEWER --> HideButton[Button hidden]
    CheckCreateAuth -- Yes --> OpenEditorNew[Open Markdown Editor: New Document]
    OpenEditorNew --> InputTitleBody[Author enters Title, Markdown content, and Initial Classification]
    InputTitleBody --> SaveDraftNew[Click 'Save as Draft']
    SaveDraftNew --> APISaveDraft[Call POST /api/v1/documents]
    APISaveDraft -- 201 Created --> ShowSaved[Show status badge: 'Draft (v1.0)']
    
    %% Flow 2: Edit existing Draft vs Create new Revision
    UserChoice -- Select Document from list --> CheckDocGrant{Has Document Grant?}
    CheckDocGrant -- No --> Show404[/404 Not Found - No metadata leaked/]
    CheckDocGrant -- Yes --> ViewCurrent[Display Current Version with badge 'CURRENT']
    
    ViewCurrent --> DocOptions{Action on Document?}
    DocOptions -- Click 'Edit / Create Revision' --> CheckHasDraft{Does an open Draft already exist?}
    CheckHasDraft -- Yes --> LoadExistingDraft[Open existing Draft for editing]
    CheckHasDraft -- No --> CreateNewDraftBranch[Create new Draft version cloned from Current]
    CreateNewDraftBranch --> LoadExistingDraft
    
    LoadExistingDraft --> EditMarkdown[Edit content in Markdown split editor]
    EditMarkdown --> AutoSave[Auto-save Draft to server]
    AutoSave --> PublishChoice{Click 'Publish as Current Version'?}
    
    PublishChoice -- Yes --> CheckPublishRole{Is Author or PO?}
    CheckPublishRole -- No --> ShowWarn[Show tooltip: 'Only PO or doc author can publish']
    CheckPublishRole -- Yes --> ConfirmPublishDialog[Show modal: 'Publish v2.0 as Current? Previous v1.0 will become Superseded']
    ConfirmPublishDialog -- Confirm --> APIPublish[Call POST /api/v1/documents/:id/publish]
    APIPublish -- 200 OK --> ReindexTrigger[System flags for background KMS re-indexing]
    APIPublish --> UpdateBadges[Current version = v2.0; Old v1.0 labeled 'Superseded']
    
    %% Flow 3: View Version History & Diffs
    DocOptions -- Click 'Version History' --> OpenHistoryTab[Open History Drawer]
    OpenHistoryTab --> SelectPastVersion[Select past version: e.g. v1.0 Superseded]
    SelectPastVersion --> RenderWarning[Display persistent banner: 'Viewing Superseded Version v1.0. This is not current.']
    SelectPastVersion --> DiffToggle[Toggle 'Compare with Current']
    DiffToggle --> ShowVisualDiff[Display visual side-by-side Markdown Diff]
    
    %% Flow 4: Access Control (Restricted Documents)
    DocOptions -- Manage Access (Restricted Doc) --> CheckIsAdmin{User is PO / Admin?}
    CheckIsAdmin -- Yes --> OpenAccessModal[Open Access Control Modal]
    OpenAccessModal --> ModifyGrants[Add or Revoke Member Grants]
    ModifyGrants --> SaveGrants[Call PUT /api/v1/documents/:id/grants]
    SaveGrants -- Success --> GrantFeedback[Immediate invalidation of revoked users' access]
